{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/ff06325fbbb8fb80e0d38cd88c925f7e.avif?t=1764855890\" width=620 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived to help your uncle with crops in the fields. But of a sudden, you've been attacked by a tractor monster. To rescue the village, you must collect crops and defeat Teddy the tractor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/fdb1568905df9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.poster.avif?t=1764855890\" width=620 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/fdb1568905df9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.webm?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/fdb1568905df9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.mp4?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important parts of Teddy the Tractor is the tractor. You will ride your tractor, upgrade it, unlock new weapons, and fight Teddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the gameplay, you move through the story by committing quests and collecting crops day by day. Time moves forward constantly, and some quests can be missed or failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/090ccba86f2fb61f8a3960ef99e30ccd.poster.avif?t=1764855890\" width=620 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/090ccba86f2fb61f8a3960ef99e30ccd.webm?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/090ccba86f2fb61f8a3960ef99e30ccd.mp4?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight various tractorheads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect corn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tractor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Teddy the Tractor\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254670?t=1764855890","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254670?t=1764855890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/2521a78faf3588737496048d4c9a122fcb5b8946/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1764855890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/2521a78faf3588737496048d4c9a122fcb5b8946/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1764855890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3519120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/ff06325fbbb8fb80e0d38cd88c925f7e.avif?t=1764855890\" width=620 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived to help your uncle with crops in the fields. But of a sudden, you've been attacked by a tractor monster. To rescue the village, you must collect crops and defeat Teddy the tractor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/fdb1568905df9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.poster.avif?t=1764855890\" width=620 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/fdb1568905df9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.webm?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/fdb1568905df9e9bccb28092ec49e9ea.mp4?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important parts of Teddy the Tractor is the tractor. You will ride your tractor, upgrade it, unlock new weapons, and fight Teddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the gameplay, you move through the story by committing quests and collecting crops day by day. Time moves forward constantly, and some quests can be missed or failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/090ccba86f2fb61f8a3960ef99e30ccd.poster.avif?t=1764855890\" width=620 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/090ccba86f2fb61f8a3960ef99e30ccd.webm?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/extras/090ccba86f2fb61f8a3960ef99e30ccd.mp4?t=1764855890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight various tractorheads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect corn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tractor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Teddy the Tractor\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254670/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1764855890","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254670/762772/92929f8c404700da6c0e39ce18e0e700803ef015/1750885021/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740269437","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254670/762772/92929f8c404700da6c0e39ce18e0e700803ef015/1750885021/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740269437","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254670/762772/92929f8c404700da6c0e39ce18e0e700803ef015/1750885021/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740269437","id":257059531,"name":"Early teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257059531/b4399a87b7e87aed971d9a90a9d505d5e8abc467/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740269437"}],"name":"Teddy the Tractor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,,11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["MA"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse